# ml/mlruns is 434MB, gitignored, and machine-local -- the full experiment
# tracking store, not just the one model actually served. The MCP server
# image bakes in ml/production_model instead (project-plan.md's Dockerfiles
# slice), a small (82KB), committed, self-contained export of just the
# registered production model -- see ml/fraud_attribution.py's comment for
# how it's produced. Do NOT add a blanket "*.txt"/"*.md" rule here: that
# would wrongly exclude ml/production_model/requirements.txt, which is part
# of the artifact MLflow saved, not documentation.
ml/mlruns/
ml/catboost_info/
ml/.ipynb_checkpoints/
ml/*.joblib

tests/
docs/
README.md
project-plan.md
project-summary.txt
testing-and-evaluation-plan.md
